  "description": "A simple solution for generating graphs in the DOT language. The generated output is plain text in DOT format, which can be rendered as an image using the Graphviz software. There are handy visualization tools like Graphviz Preview for Visual Studio Code or online tools like https://viz-js.com or http://magjac.com/graphviz-visual-editor, where you paste the DOT code to view its visualization.",
